        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: W41AP channel 41, Sandusky Register\n- Companies: Sandusky Newspapers, Inc.\n- Places: Sandusky, Ohio; Port Clinton; Lake Erie Islands; Vacationland\n\nFacts:\n- W41AP channel 41 is an analog low power television station in Sandusky, Ohio.\n- Sandusky Newspapers, Inc. owns W41AP channel 41.\n- Sandusky Newspapers, Inc. publishes the Sandusky Register.\n- The Sandusky Register is a daily newspaper serving Sandusky, Ohio.\n- The Sandusky Register also serves nearby Port Clinton and the Lake Erie Islands, which are collectively known regionally as Vacationland.",
